index 6bddff1..5dd4a89 100644
--- a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
+++ b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
@@ -96,3 +96,45 @@ __Request:__
 __Response:__
 
 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
+## `POST /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscriptions`
+
+Registers the push subscription a browser got from its push service, so that notifications also reach that device. You can only manage your own subscriptions.
+
+| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
+|-----------|------|----------|-------------|
+| `endpoint` | string | Yes | The push service URL for this device |
+| `p256dh_key` | string | Yes | The subscription's public key |
+| `auth_key` | string | Yes | The subscription's auth secret |
+
+__Request:__
+
+```json
+{
+  "push_subscription": {
+    "endpoint": "https://push.example.com/subscriptions/1234",
+    "p256dh_key": "BNcRdreALRFXTkOOUHK1EtK2wtaz5Ry4YfYCA_0QTpQt",
+    "auth_key": "tBHItJI5svbpez7KI4CCXg"
+  }
+}
+```
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `201 Created`. Posting the same endpoint again refreshes the keys instead of creating a second subscription.
+
+```json
+{
+  "id": "03f5va03bpuvkcjemcxl73ho2",
+  "endpoint": "https://push.example.com/subscriptions/1234",
+  "created_at": "2025-11-19T04:03:58.000Z"
+}
+```
+
+## `DELETE /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscriptions/:id`
+
+Stops notifications from reaching a device.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content` on success.
diff --git a/docs/docker-deployment.md b/docs/docker-deployment.md
